      "reason": "Resolve confounding from truncation, positional encoding, and candidate eligibility before interpreting deletion effects as sensitivity to recent versus older history.",
      "query": "BERT4Rec inference history perturbation evaluation: how should recent versus older interaction deletion control the original visible context window, absolute positional embeddings, appended MASK position, and fixed unseen-item candidate eligibility?"
    },
